  "ALL_TEXT": "86 INT. BUFFALO SHED - DAY \nThe trio close the shed\u2019s door, when VEDA leaves them to look \nfor a weapon of defense. \nLEAD GOON \nBriefcase aedi \nVEDA \nEm briefcase?? \nLEAD GOON \nContainer, briefcase ekkada unnaayo \ncheppu... \nVEDA \nEm container em briefcase? \nGOVARDHAN \nIcheyyi VEDA nee deggara unte! \nVEDA \nNuvvu noru moosukuntaava?... \nAnavasaranga vaagi leni doubts \npettaku... \nGOVARDHAN \nUnte ivvachu gaa... \nVEDA \nEkkadundhi??? Cheppu nuvve... \nekkadanna kanipisthunda naa meedha \noka briefcase leda container? \nASSISTANT GOON \nNaatakaalu cheyakandi... \nVEDA \nEvaru meeru??? Evaru pampichaaru \nmimmalni? \nLEAD GOON \nMundu nenu adiginavi iyyi... \ntharavaatha enni kaburlu \ncheppamanna cheptha... \nGOVARDHAN \nIcheyi VEDA... \nVEDA \nMalli maatlaadithe, vaadu kaadhu \nnene thantha ninnu. Noru musuko. \nNee vaagudi valla vaadu nijangaane \nmana deggara undhanukuntunnaadu. \nSULOCHANA is looking at them in fear. There are four goons. \nAll pretty tough. \nSULOCHANA \n(whispers to VEDA) \nEmanna cheyyi VEDA... Bhayanga \nundi. \nVEDA whispers back \nVEDA \nNenem cheyyanu... idhi cinema \nkaadhu naa laanti bakkodu naluguru \nrowdielni chaavabaadhataaniki.. \nThe LEAD GOON gets impatient \nLEAD GOON \nEnti gusagusalu? \nGOVARDHAN \n(Looking at SULOCHANA) \nBriefcase ekkadhundho cheppaada?? \nTheesukosthaada?? \nVEDA looses it at this point. He rushes towards GOVARDHAN to \nattack him \nVEDA \nChepthe ardham kaadha musukomante!? \nGOVARDHAN yells at VEDA \nGOVARDHAN \nEnti nannu kodathaava? Nee kanna \npeddonni. \nBy now VEDA is on GOVARDHAN, punching him. GOVARDHAN is \nyelling obscenities, reaching for his pocket, trying to pull \nhis kerchief out and bite VEDA. The goons are looking at \nthem, wondering what the ruckus is about. One of them is \nholding SULOCHANA so that she does not escape. The LEAD GOON \nwaits for a bit, then walks up to them, points a gun to their \nhead and warns them. \nASSISTANT GOON \nEe naatakaalu chaalu. Lesi \ncontainer briefcase daggiriki \nthesukuvelandi. \nThe two slowly scramble to their feet. \nVEDA \nIkkade pakkane unnaayi. Randi \nistha... \nGOVARDHAN is shocked. \nGOVARDHAN \nNenu cheppale... antha veedey \nchesaadu... appatinundi nangi \nnaatakaalu aaduthunnaadu... \nGOVARDHAN \npoddunundi idhantha chesindhi nuvve \nkadha... \nVEDA shoots an angry glance at him. SULOCHANA wonders what is \ngoing on. There are two goons with VEDA - the LEAD GOON and \nanother one. Two goons - the ASSISTANT GOON and the SUB \nASSISTANT GOON stays back with SULOCHANA and GOVARDHAN. The \nLEAD GOON slips because of cow-dung on the ground and looses \nbalance. The gun in his hand falls into the dung near \nGOVARDHAN. The goons with GOVARDHAN and SULOCHANA run and \nassist the man on the ground. There are a few realization \nglances - VEDA signals GOVARDHAN to pick up the gun. \nGOVARDHAN refuses. VEDA vigorously uses his eyes to convey \nthe message across to GOVARDHAN, who doesn't want to put his \nhand in the dung. VEDA makes a dash for the gun and reaches \nit - pushing some dung onto GOVARDHAN's shoes in the process. \nGOVARDHAN \nBhudhundha??? Vochi clean cheyi!!! \nVEDA stares angrily at GOVARDHAN \nLEAD GOON \nChaalu inka naatakaalu... gun ivvu. \nVEDA wonders what to do. SULOCHANA looks tense, wondering \nwhat will happen next. OVARDHAN bites his nails, wearing his \nwater flask. The LEAD GOON walks towards VEDA in a bid to get \nthe gun back. VEDA takes a step back and unexpectedly hits \nthe LEAD GOON on the head with the gun. The other three men \npounce on VEDA, trying to wrestle the gun away from him. \nSULOCHANA and GOVARDHAN stare in shock. VEDA wrestles with \nthe men. \nVEDA \nEmanna cheyyandi!! \nSULOCHANA looks around, and finds a big stick. She hits the \nSUB-ASSISTANT GOON with the stick. The stick breaks but the \nSUB-ASSISTANT GOON also looses consciousness. SULOCHANA goes \nlooking around for another stick when the ASSISTANT GOON \nleaves VEDA and goes behind SULOCHANA to hurt her. He grabs \nher by the arm and slaps her. GOVARDHAN now runs to SULOCHANA \nand the ASSISTANT GOON. Not knowing what to do, he uses his \nkerchief and bites the ASSISTANT GOON, who tries to get away \nand hits his head on a raise, loosing consciousness. \nGOVARDHAN rubs off the dung onto ASSISTANT GOON's shirt. The \nremaining goon tries to overpower VEDA but by now he is the \nonly one remaining and looses confidence. GOVARDHAN folds his \nkerchief neatly and puts it back. They walk to VEDA, as the \nlast goon runs away. \nSULOCHANA \nIppudenti?... Ekkadiki velthunnaam? \nVEDA \nNaa intiki veldaam naagurinchi \nevvariki theleedhu kadha. \nGOVARDHAN \nSare edo okati aghoriddam... inka \nchesedemundi... ee chethalo \nkurchune kanna adhe better. \nCUT TO:",
